                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-AI-001] MCP tool outputs are unbounded - no truncation or size caps on any of the 6 tool results -- buff_expand embeds the FULL generated Rust source in the tool text (tools.rs:638-642); buff_check returns every diagnostic uncapped (399-428); buff_complete serializes the entire CompletionResponse (510-525); buff_format returns full source (596-600). Grep for truncat/max/cap/limit in buff-mcp/src returns zero matches. Large .buff inputs funnel megabytes into agent context windows. Verified: no outbound LLM calls, no API keys, stdio-only, tools-only capabilities (no sampling)."
                                                     },
                                         "ruleId":  "BUFF-ai-cost",
