                                                                                                   }
                                                                                    }
                                                           }
                                                       ]
                                     },
                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-AI-002] buff ai context generates an unbounded context pack and instructs pasting the entire file into an AI tool -- build_context_pack walks every .buff file under project_root (collect_buff_files:572-604 skips target/node_modules/.git/hidden but has no depth, file-count, or size cap), enumerates ALL PreludeType/AssocFn/InstanceFn signatures, then prints or writes the pack; header says \u0027Paste this entire file into your AI tool\u0027. On a large repo the paste target grows without bound. Command is otherwise CLEAN: fully offline (doc: \u0027does NOT call any AI APIs\u0027), no network, no shell-out, no API keys; verify path is local T55 typecheck + Levenshtein hints."
                                                     },
