                                                         "text":  "[AUD-AM-002] Playground CTA path inconsistent; breaks in deployed Pages layout -- benchmarks.html nav \u0027Playground\u0027 CTA uses ../playground/index.html while website/index.html and website/app.js try-links use ./playground/index.html. pages.yml publishes website/* at the site root with playground/ as a subdirectory, so the DEPLOYED benchmarks page escapes the site root and 404s; conversely index.html CTAs 404 when website/ is served raw locally. Exactly one path form can be correct per serving layout."
