                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-AM-003] Registry download metrics exist â€” aggregate-only, privacy-clean -- The only usage-metrics surface in the repo: every tarball download calls record_download (handlers.rs:861); per-package totals are exposed via GET /api/v1/packages/{name}/stats ({\"downloads\":N}) and feed search ranking. Storage rows are keyed (name, version, count) only â€” storage_sqlite.rs:703, storage.rs:401 defaults to 0. No user/IP attribution is persisted; the IP rate-limiter keeps rolling 5-minute in-memory timestamps, pruned per request, never exposed. No action required â€” documented for the audit trail."
