                                                         "text":  "[AUD-AM-004] Third-party font/CDN fetches are the only external requests â€” zero beacons -- Exhaustive read of website/ and playground/ HTML+JS found ZERO analytics (no GA/GTM/Plausible/segment/mixpanel/posthog/sendBeacon). Only third-party fetches: Google Fonts CSS (website/index.html:11-13, benchmarks.html:10-12, playground/index.html:12-14) and CodeMirror 5 from cdnjs (playground/index.html:17-23). Google Fonts logs visitor IPs (GDPR enforcement precedent); cdnjs is a supply-chain surface. Playground wasm loads from local ./pkg only â€” no phoning home."
