                                                         "text":  "[AUD-AR-001] 10 crates silently opt out of the workspace-wide clippy -D warnings gate via undocumented crate-level allow(clippy::all, dead_code) -- Crate-level #![allow(clippy::all, dead_code, unused_imports, mismatched_lifetime_syntaxes)] in buff-lsp, buff-mcp, buff-geo, buff-game, buff-auth, buff-db, buff-email, buff-config, buff-scrape, buff-image (all at src/lib.rs line 1). CI runs \u0027cargo clippy $CI_CRATES --all-targets -- -D warnings\u0027 over the FULL workspace (since ITER-32), so these 10 crates are effectively exempt from every clippy lint plus dead-code detection. No rationale comment accompanies the allows, and no AGENTS.md documents them; contrast the documented per-crate #![allow(clippy::result_large_err)] which always carries inline justification."
