                                                         "text":  "[AUD-FT-005] Registry server lacks graceful shutdown (axum::serve without with_graceful_shutdown) -- main.rs:68 runs `axum::serve(listener, app(state)).await?` with no with_graceful_shutdown wiring, unlike the ui_dev server in the same workspace (buff-lang-cli/src/ui_dev/mod.rs:110-116 which uses tokio::signal + with_graceful_shutdown and explicitly documents draining in-flight requests). On SIGTERM/Ctrl+C the process dies mid-request; with the T57 durable SQLite backend this can abandon an in-flight publish transaction."
