                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-FT-007] web3 flattens provider error chains via map_err(|e| e.to_string()) -- get_chainid (lib.rs:580) and its sibling call (586) convert typed provider errors with `.map_err(|e| e.to_string())?`, discarding the error chain (RPC method, provider type, source cause) in violation of the project\u0027s thiserror/`#[from]` error-propagation convention. This is one of only two genuine map_err-loss sites in non-test src (the rest are codegen templates that intentionally emit this pattern into USER programs, e.g. instance_fns_extra.rs:1313 for Buff\u0027s `validate` lowering - by design, not a repo defect)."
                                                     },
