                                                         "text":  "[AUD-PR-007] DR-015 and DR-014 exist only under unnumbered filenames -- docs/p5_9-compliance-report.md:24 cites \u0027DR-015 + migration guide\u0027 and debt-zero-best-practices.md:225 cites DR-014, but no dr-015*.md or dr-014*.md exists in .sisyphus/decisions/. DR-015 self-identifies inside deprecation-phase-b.md:3 (\u0027Decision Record: DR-015\u0027); DR-014 maps to selfhost-feasibility.md (self-host/README.md:41). Numbered siblings dr-016..dr-020 exist, making the two unnumbered records undiscoverable by filename. Note: deny.toml contains zero DR references (audit-prompt premise corrected)."
