                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-PRIV-001] Raw publish bearer tokens serialized publicly in GET /api/v1/package response -- VersionInfo is #[derive(Serialize)] and documented as the GET /api/v1/package/{name} JSON body (storage.rs:56-90). publish() sets author to the raw bearer token when no OAuth session exists (handlers.rs:440-443), persisted in versions.author and loaded back into the response (storage_sqlite.rs:316-330). Any anonymous client can therefore read every static-token publisher\u0027s plaintext credential with one curl. The field doc itself states \u0027The author (publish token)\u0027."
                                                     },
