                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-PRIV-003] Publish + session tokens stored unhashed (plaintext) in SQLite at rest -- tokens and sessions tables store raw token strings as PRIMARY KEY (storage_sqlite.rs:88-90, 106-110); add_token INSERTs plaintext (:208-216) and create_session INSERTs the raw UUID session token (:569-576). No hashing anywhere in the crate. WAL mode (init, :194) additionally spreads live copies into registry.db-wal side files."
                                                     },
