                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-PRIV-004] OAuth sessions never expire - no TTL column or time check -- sessions schema holds only (token, user_id, created_at) (storage_sqlite.rs:106-110); validate_session (:579-595) performs no time-based check, despite the Storage trait doc promising Ok(None) for \u0027unknown / expired\u0027 (storage.rs:325-331). The buff_session cookie also sets no Max-Age (oauth.rs:290). A leaked cookie is valid indefinitely; logout is the only lifecycle event."
                                                     },
