                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-PRIV-005] No user-data deletion path - users table rows are immutable -- The route table exposes no DELETE endpoint for accounts or user rows (lib.rs:279-302); only /auth/logout removes a session (oauth.rs:316-334 -\u003e storage_sqlite.rs:597-605). users rows (github_login, github_id, created_at; storage_sqlite.rs:100-105) and versions.author identities persist indefinitely with no erasure or export mechanism, leaving LGPD Art. 16/18 requests technically unfulfillable."
