                                                         "text":  "[AUD-RF-005] Pedantic-tier modernization debt is unmeasured and un-gated; verified instances in buff-lang-error (leaf crate) -- Because CI gates only default clippy (-D warnings), pedantic-tier modernization debt accumulates invisibly. Verified via targeted `cargo clippy -W clippy::pedantic` runs: buff-lang-error/src/diagnostic.rs has three instances â€” :474 and :523 out.push_str(\u0026format!(...)) (clippy::format_push_string â€” extra allocation per rendered diagnostic), and :606 source[..start].rfind(\u0027\\n\u0027).map(|i| i + 1).unwrap_or(0) (clippy::map_unwrap_or; sibling :609-612 has the same shape for line_end). Scale sample on one mid-size framework crate (buff-mock, all-targets, pedantic): 92 missing #[must_use], 27 doc_markdown backticks, 24 format_push_string, 16 redundant closures, 9 map_unwrap_or, 3 let-else rewrites. buff-plugins adds single_match_else at its dispatch match. These are polish-tier (no correctness impact) but the leaf crate diagnostic.rs sits on every user-facing error render."
