                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-RGD-001] No privacy notice or recorded legal basis at the GitHub OAuth consent surface -- The /auth/github/login endpoint redirects users to GitHub without any privacy notice, data-collection disclosure, or documented legal basis. Repo-wide grep for privacy|LGPD|GDPR|consent across .rs/.md/.html/.js returns zero hits in registry code or docs. The registry processes personal data (GitHub login + numeric id, oauth.rs:70-74) upon login and persists it durably (storage_sqlite.rs:100-105 users table)."
                                                     },
