                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-RGD-002] No data subject rights endpoints (access/export/rectification/erasure) for persisted GitHub identity -- The complete route table (lib.rs:279-302) contains only publish, package, download, resolve, badges, stats, search, multipart publish/download, health, ready, and four auth routes (login/callback/logout/whoami). No endpoint lets a user access, export, correct, or delete their stored personal data. OAuth logout deletes only the session row; users table rows (storage_sqlite.rs:100-105) persist in durable WAL SQLite with no deletion code path anywhere in the crate."
                                                     },
