                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-SCH-001] .buffmap version field is written but never validated on deserialization -- MAP_FORMAT_VERSION (=1) is stamped into every .buffmap (L135) and the module doc (L17-22) claims consumers can use it to detect schema changes, but deserialize() (L93-96) parses BuffMapFile and calls from_buff_map_file() (L151) without ever comparing file.version to MAP_FORMAT_VERSION. The panic hook reads sidecars through this exact path (panic_hook.rs:60 read_from_file). A future v2 sidecar is silently accepted by a v1 reader and misparsed as garbage mappings instead of failing with a clear version error."
                                                     },
