                                     },
                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-SCH-002] T57 registry endpoints return ad-hoc json! bodies duplicating typed DTO shapes -- multipart_publish (L831-838) hand-builds {name, version, deps} via serde_json::json!, byte-shaping the same object as the typed PublishResponse DTO (storage.rs:159-166) returned by the legacy POST /api/v1/publish (handlers.rs:468-473). get_stats (L897-900) emits {name, downloads} with no DTO struct at all, unlike every other endpoint (SearchResultRow, ResolveResponse, PackageMetadata). The registry has no published schema, so these untyped bodies are the de-facto contract."
                                                     },
