                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-SCH-003] Registry mixes singular /api/v1/package and plural /api/v1/packages resource nouns -- Within the consistently-versioned /api/v1/ prefix (verified across all 9 package routes, L279-290), the v1.6 read endpoint is singular (/api/v1/package/{name}, L280) while all T57 additions are plural (/api/v1/packages/{name}/badges L283, /stats L284, POST /api/v1/packages/{name} L289, /{version}/download L290-295). /health, /ready and /auth/* are intentionally unprefixed (probes/OAuth). The noun split is a REST-consistency wart, documented as-is in crates/buff-registry/AGENTS.md."
                                                     },
