                                                                                                   }
                                                                                    }
                                                           }
                                                       ]
                                     },
                                     {
                                         "message":  {
                                                         "text":  "[AUD-TC-005] All cargo test jobs are advisory (continue-on-error: true), so no test gap or regression can block a merge -- Both cargo test jobs in ci.yml (test-core at line 117, test-framework at line 145, the latter commented \u0027pre-existing API drift\u0027) run with continue-on-error: true, and CONTRIBUTING.md documents them under \u0027Advisory jobs (do not block merge)\u0027. The repo\u0027s own README exit criteria (\u0027cargo test --workspace -\u003e 100% pass\u0027) are therefore enforced nowhere. This converts every other finding in this audit from \u0027already partially mitigated by CI\u0027 to \u0027fully unprotected\u0027: a red test suite passes silently."
                                                     },
